			<div class="content" id="post-content-3654215">
									

<p>Pretty much! I lived with a newborn for a very short amount of time (thank god) and it was totally odd, having this tiny human who didn't even have muscle control and couldn't do the tiniest thing, like burp, without assistance. I was about as awkward as Kit around the kid, trying to hold conversations with this thing that couldn't reply but looked so human.</p>
<p>It's almost in the uncanny valley honestly.</p>

